{"id":816,"date":"2025-08-21T12:01:43","date_gmt":"2025-08-21T12:01:43","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/bombayfoodstuff\/?post_type=product&#038;p=816"},"modified":"2025-08-26T08:12:09","modified_gmt":"2025-08-26T08:12:09","slug":"ginger-dry","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/product\/ginger-dry\/","title":{"rendered":"Ginger (Dry Adrak )"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2><b>Ginger (Adrak)<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><b>Hindi Name :<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Adrak<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Botanical Name :<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Zingiber officinale<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Family Name :<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Roscoe Zingiberaceae<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Commercial Part :<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> The rhizome<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ginger, known as <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Adrak<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in Hindi, is one of the world\u2019s most versatile and valued spices. Its pungent, warming flavor and distinct aroma make it an essential ingredient in Asian, Indian, and Oriental cuisines. Fresh ginger is widely used in chutneys, pickles, curry pastes, and beverages, while dried ginger powder is a key component of many spice blends, including curry powders.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><b>Culinary Uses<\/b><\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enhances flavor in curries, soups, sauces, and stir-fries.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Used in baking\u2014gingerbread, biscuits, cakes, and puddings.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Adds zest to beverages like ginger tea, ginger ale, ginger beer, and herbal infusions.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A staple in chutneys, jams, and preserves.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4><b>Health Benefits<\/b><\/h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ginger is globally recognized for its medicinal properties, particularly as a <\/span><b>digestive aid<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. It stimulates saliva and digestive fluids, helping relieve:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Indigestion and gas<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Stomach cramps and diarrhea<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nausea and morning sickness<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Inflammatory conditions and sore throat<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4><b>Why Choose Our Ginger?<\/b><\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sourced from the finest farms ensuring freshness and purity.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Available in multiple forms: fresh rhizomes, dried slices, powder, and extracts.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Suitable for food manufacturers, spice exporters, herbal supplement producers, and beverage industries.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>Producing States:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Kerala, Karnataka, and Northeastern regions of India.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We supply premium-quality ginger in fresh, dried, and powdered forms for food, beverage, and pharmaceutical industries. Known for its pungent flavor and digestive benefits, ginger is a key ingredient in curries, chutneys, bakery items, and herbal drinks. Our ginger is sourced from trusted farms, ensuring consistent quality, purity, and global export standards.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":1041,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[25],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-816","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-uncategorized","first","instock","shipping-taxable","product-type-simple"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product\/816","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/product"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=816"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1041"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=816"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"product_brand","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product_brand?post=816"},{"taxonomy":"product_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product_cat?post=816"},{"taxonomy":"product_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product_tag?post=816"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}